<title>JAPAN: Japan's August vehicle production falls 2.1% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's August vehicle production falls 2.1% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's vehicle production fell 2.1 percent in August to 663,868 units from a year earlier, the Japan Automobile Manufacturers' Association (JAMA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					    AUG	     YR/YR PCT</p>
<p>  Cars				  489,087	     -2.4</p>
<p>  Trucks				171,027	     -1.7</p>
<p>  Buses				   3,754	    +26.9</p>
<p>  Total				 663,868	     -2.1</p>
</text>
